# Context Profile: Quark Ledger (Public Client)
- Scope: Read-Only Public Journal UI (Next.js App Router).
- Data Engine: Supabase Client utilizing ANON KEY ONLY. Never import or use SERVICE_ROLE_KEY.
- Design Rules:
  - Aesthetics: Neo-Brutalist Anti-AI Broadside Magazine.
  - Borders: Strict 1px sharp edges (`border-ledger-border`). Zero border-radius (`rounded-none`).
  - Colors: Paper (`#F6F4EE`), Ink (`#111111`), Border (`#D8D4C8`), Accent (`#D9381E`).
  - Strict exclusion: No Framer Motion micro-springs, no modern blue/purple gradients, no glassmorphism, no box-shadows.
- Typography:
  - Headlines: Serif (`font-headline`).
  - Body: Serif (`font-body`).
  - System/Metadata: Monospace (`font-mono`).
- Responsibilities:
  - Page generation, SEO metadata, RSS/Atom feeds, reading performance.
  - Absolutely zero data-mutation forms or editor packages allowed here.
